{title: 431 - Over Yonder}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #431 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: Ab}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 431}
{meta: category Doctrines - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Ab]Come let us sing of [Ebsus]home[Eb7]land,
[Eb]Down by the [Eb7]crystal [Ab]sea;
[Db]Wonderful [Eb7]land where [Ab]Jesus
[Eb7]Buildeth a [Bb7]mansion for [Eb]me.[Eb7]
[Ab]Over [Db]yon[Ab]der, down by the crystal [Eb7]sea,
[Eb7]Over yonder, [Ab]there’s where I long [Db]to [Ab]be,
[Ab]No more [Db]sor[Ab]row, [C]toil, grief, nor [Fm]care,
In the [Db]homeland [G]bright and [Ab]fair,
[Db]O[Ab]ver, [B]o[Eb7]ver [Ab]the[Db]re.[Ab]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Refrain}
[Ab]Over yonder, [Ebsus]down by [Eb7]the crystal sea,
[Eb]Over yonder, [Eb7]there's where I [Ab]long to be,
[Db]No more [Eb7]sorrow, toil, [Ab]grief, nor care,
[Eb7]In [Bb7]the homeland [Eb]bright [Eb7]and fair,
[Ab][Db]Over, [Ab]over [Eb7]there.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Ab]Water [Ebsus]of life [Eb7]there floweth,
[Eb]Fruit [Eb7]in [Ab]abundant store;
[Db]Citizens [Eb7]of [Ab]that country
[Eb7]Hunger [Bb7]and [Eb]thirst [Eb7]never more.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Ab]Come go [Ebsus]with me [Eb7]to homeland,
[Eb]Jesus [Eb7]invites [Ab]you there;
[Db]Help [Eb7]spread [Ab]the invitation,
[Eb7]Tell [Bb7]it [Eb]to [Eb7]men everywhere.
{end_of_verse}
